# Non-static monitor functions the daemon (default static-bundle config, x86_64) never
# reaches, per `ld --gc-sections --print-gc-sections` (scripts/run_warning_gate.sh --push).
#
# Each name here is accepted; any NEW unreachable non-static function fails the pre-push
# gate. Typical legitimate entries: test hooks (*_test_*), pure parsers/helpers called only
# from tests/, and paths only another configure option or architecture links in.
#
# Baseline captured 2026-11-15. Entries not yet triaged; candidates for deletion include
# dict_remv / dict_entry_remv / dict_shrink, stats_buffer_write, ring_buffer_resend.
# When you delete a function or start calling it, remove its line (the gate prints stale
# entries as a note).
